{"parse": {"title": "LAFP-03", "pageid": 136120, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/LAFP-02\" title=\"LAFP-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">LAFP-03</span><a href=\"/wiki/LAFP-04\" title=\"LAFP-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">LAFP</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">03</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.AD.94.E6.A1.88.E5.9C.A8.E7.9B.92.E5.BA.95\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"答案在盒底\">答案在盒底</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 答案在盒底</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Answer at the Bottom</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>别<span class=\"color-value\"></span>轻<span class=\"color-value\"></span>易<span class=\"color-value\"></span>接<span class=\"color-value\"></span>受<span class=\"color-value\"></span>准<span class=\"color-value\"></span>备<span class=\"color-value\"></span>好<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>说<span class=\"color-value\"></span>辞<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 3610103</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_6_at_04.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_6_at_04\"><img alt=\"3_6_at_04\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/Cg-3_6_at_04.png/600px-Cg-3_6_at_04.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/Cg-3_6_at_04.png/900px-Cg-3_6_at_04.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/Cg-3_6_at_04.png/1200px-Cg-3_6_at_04.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648710.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-648710.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648710.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648710.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-648710.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648710.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-648710.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648710.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>一定有一种能够描述世间万物的统一的理论。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648710.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-648710.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648710.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648710.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-648710.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648710.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-648710.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648710.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>因为任何谜题都有其解答。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>线条在纸上逐渐成形，搭建起框架，等待着一个字母来锚定答案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648710.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-648710.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648710.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648710.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-648710.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648710.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-648710.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648710.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>因为世界是一个填字游戏。只要沿着线索推演……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314314.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/HeadIconSmall-314314.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314314.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314314.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/HeadIconSmall-314314.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314314.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/HeadIconSmall-314314.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314314.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>……呃。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-314310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-314310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-314310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>真该死。人类什么时候才能进化掉睡眠？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>研究员用力地甩了甩脑袋，视线聚焦在桌面混乱的格子线上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他推开稿纸和文件，点亮设备屏幕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>下午三点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>只过去了六个小时。看来那家伙在破坏公物之余还是干了些活。副作用减轻了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>我是把说明书一起扔了吗？上面写了什么来着……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314314.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/HeadIconSmall-314314.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314314.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314314.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/HeadIconSmall-314314.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314314.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/HeadIconSmall-314314.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314314.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>算了，记得当时最先排除的就是致死性。其他毛病也无所谓。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他从纸张下头摸出金属罐，往手掌上倒了两枚彩色的小东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>最好有点用处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314314.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/HeadIconSmall-314314.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314314.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314314.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/HeadIconSmall-314314.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314314.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/HeadIconSmall-314314.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314314.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>“玩具箱”的研究，司辰的请求，新成果……还有洛伦兹，行吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>麻烦总是扎堆出现，从来如此。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>但麻烦来得越多，离答案就越近。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_6_at_04.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_6_at_04\"><img alt=\"3_6_at_04\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/Cg-3_6_at_04.png/600px-Cg-3_6_at_04.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/Cg-3_6_at_04.png/900px-Cg-3_6_at_04.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/Cg-3_6_at_04.png/1200px-Cg-3_6_at_04.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>——我们不能再制造更多麻烦了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>磁流体拍着桌子，试图中止这场混乱的讨论。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>遗憾的是，在拉普拉斯，大声怒吼只会引来更高声的反驳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>好啊！只要取消审批制度，让我们每人安静地工作上十天半个月，把用来写该死的报告的时间都花在实验上！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>我看这才是一切麻烦的原因！那家伙在房间里关上几年也处理不完所有报告！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_4_b2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi\"><img alt=\"2_4_b2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png/600px-Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png/900px-Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png/1200px-Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>正视现在的情况，兔毛手袋研究员！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_6_at_03.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_6_at_03\"><img alt=\"3_6_at_03\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/Cg-3_6_at_03.png/600px-Cg-3_6_at_03.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/Cg-3_6_at_03.png/900px-Cg-3_6_at_03.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/Cg-3_6_at_03.png/1200px-Cg-3_6_at_03.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>“玩具箱”已经暂时修理完毕，它造成的沟通问题也随之消失。但我们需要一个合适的方法来避免类似事件再次发生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>并且，我们得弄清楚它为什么能带来如此大范围的影响，让几乎整个拉普拉斯都用奇怪的符号系统讲话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>我认为这和暴雨症候有相似之处。现有的研究进度太过缓慢，为此，我需要各位——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-304714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-304714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-304714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>又来了，你又要说是那场“语言异化症”阻碍了工作进度，是吧？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_4_b2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi\"><img alt=\"2_4_b2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png/600px-Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png/900px-Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png/1200px-Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>我来告诉你，无论是用符码还是十进制或者咖啡杯上的拉花来交流，都不会妨碍我手头的任何事务。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>兔毛手袋模仿着乌尔里希的语气，拖长了音调。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>应急手册只会用垃圾数据填满你那容积有限的脑袋，无论碰到什么情况，我的意见都是——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>各凭本事，少管闲事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>嗯，听起来你已经原谅了在食堂点餐买到魔精饲料的事。在俄罗斯方块基础上演化的字符的确很难立刻看懂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>我早说过，这个箱子无法被常规的神秘学攻击毁掉，物理意义上的打击也不行。知难而退吧，兔毛手袋。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515610.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-515610.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515610.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515610.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-515610.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515610.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-515610.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515610.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>毁掉？绝对不行！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>磁流体几乎在玻璃缸内弹跳起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>阿德勒研究员上次说过，基金会正在催我们拿出一份有说服力的研究成果！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>他们不是第一次以“自由散漫”为理由抨击拉普拉斯的现状，我们需要这个箱子，用它模拟推演出可靠的应急预案！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>知道了，反正就是随便交出些什么，堵上他们的嘴就成。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>要不你就把浪费实验材料的家伙聚起来，每人发一张写着“洛伦兹”的工牌交上去吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>而且我听说基金会最近也挺“热闹”的，里边闹腾的声音和奥氏体的晶格点阵一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515611.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-515611.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515611.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515611.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-515611.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515611.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-515611.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515611.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它显然正在极力调节自己的情绪，发声设备的震动逐渐趋于平缓。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>够了。现在，我希望你们所有人都回到今天的讨论上来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>指针研究员。X研究员。你们的数据分析成果如何？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>被叫到名字的两位研究员早就习惯了研究室的吵闹，知道保持安静以免无故卷入其中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>指针把一叠文件推向乌尔里希。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>我的部分在这里。附有总结方便司辰查阅。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>简单来说，“洪水”改变了“暴雨”的性质。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>过往的大部分数据都无法取用，那些都成了垃圾。而可靠的模型需要反复检验，现在得出的结论仅供参考。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>这足够了。我相信我们会很快根据新情况做出调整应对。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>所有人都默认了这句话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>关于“玩具箱”外泄的神秘术波动，有什么发现？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>仅从数据看，神秘术波动的量级远超正常水平。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>我也请教了我认识的所有神秘术与“语言”“文字”及“声音”有关的神秘学家，他们没有在其中发现人为痕迹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>猜想一，这个箱子是一个天然的神秘学物件。猜想二，它底部的那个秘密，其力量超越了大多数神秘学家的理解范畴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他停了停，似乎略有迟疑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>还有一个我个人的想法。路德维希先生的神秘术波动……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_6_at_25.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_6_at_25\"><img alt=\"3_6_at_25\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/Cg-3_6_at_25.png/600px-Cg-3_6_at_25.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/Cg-3_6_at_25.png/900px-Cg-3_6_at_25.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/Cg-3_6_at_25.png/1200px-Cg-3_6_at_25.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——咚！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>会议室的大门被猛地推开，重重摔在墙面。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_4_b2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi\"><img alt=\"2_4_b2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png/600px-Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png/900px-Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png/1200px-Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>所有人都惊讶地望向冲进会议室的身影。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang\"><img alt=\"1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png/600px-Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png/900px-Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_bg_lapulasizoulang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301020.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-301020.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301020.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301020.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-301020.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301020.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/HeadIconSmall-301020.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301020.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>哑谜先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>门没锁。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>访客毫不客气地推门而入。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>你最后一次提交的审批单我已经在上周三处理过了，X。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>还有，你和冷周六都可以停止提交兔毛手袋那个项目的试药申请了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>哦，我有一个朋友……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>星锑更加不行。她全身上下没有一根头发丝不在大声叫喊着“我是神秘学家”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>我会妥善处理好这件事。毕竟是我先向兔毛手袋询问了重启那个项目的可行性。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>那是个很好的研究方向，适用于人类的苦目树提取物解毒剂，以及普适性更高的、具有提神效果的可食用提取物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他自然地说出了这一长串词汇，就像在念背好的台词。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>您不必在意，我看过项目书，它请教过我几个问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>这本该是保密内容……算了，在有结果之前，就当这项研究不存在吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>你们都是纯粹的神秘学家，本就对苦目素有一定耐受。而直接让纯血的人类参与对他们太过危险。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>正好。也该让我四分之一的神秘学家血统起到点作用。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>我明白，哑谜先生。我无意也无权干涉任何人的决定。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>我只是拿到了一份您应当过目的文件。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>这地方需要我看的文件实在不少。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>您知道“玩具箱”损坏造成的“语言异化症”吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>虽然外部世界恢复了正常，但箱子里出现了很多有趣的情景。据说里头所有家伙的行为都逐渐向着模式化、统一化靠近。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>当然，这是乌尔里希先生的描述，并非我亲眼所见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>具体内容就在上面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他递出手里的东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>我全部读完了，详尽且完备。应该足以拿给基金会交差。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>乌尔里希先生认为它还没有足够的说服力，因此一直没有提交它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>做研究是很容易在小巷子里越走越深的，这种时候需要其他人来协助决断。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>至少我个人是这么想。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>而且，箱子里的神秘术波动中，掺杂有与那位渡鸦先生极其相似的波形。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>我比对过，与其他的模拟数据都不同。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>X顺利地说完了他准备好的所有台词。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这足够了。蝴蝶扇动了翅膀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他退出房间，没忘记顺手合上大门。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-314310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-314310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-314310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>……乌尔里希。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_4_b2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi\"><img alt=\"2_4_b2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png/600px-Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png/900px-Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png/1200px-Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314313.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/HeadIconSmall-314313.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314313.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314313.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/HeadIconSmall-314313.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314313.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/HeadIconSmall-314313.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314313.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>——乌尔里希！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>你“忘掉”的这份报告，我帮你拿来了。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "LAFP-03"}}